# Declare feeds

Feeds provide caller-filtered live views.

```trellis
model OrdersWatchInput { customerId: string; }
model OrdersWatchEvent { orderId: string; status: string; }
feed "Orders.Watch" {
  version "v1";
  input OrdersWatchInput;
  event OrdersWatchEvent;
}
```

Generate the SDK and implement the generated feed registration in the service.
